<!doctype html>
<html>
<head>
	<title></title>
</head>
<body>
<div class="gmail_default" style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: small; font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;, serif;">
<div class="gmail_default" style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: small;">
<div>
<div style="font-size: 12.8px;"><font color="#000000" face="arial, helvetica, sans-serif" style="font-size: 12.8px; line-height: 18.2857px;">Hello&nbsp;</font><span style="font-size: small;">{!Contact.FirstName}</span><span style="font-size: 12.8px; line-height: 18.2857px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">,</span></div>

<div style="font-size: 12.8px;">&nbsp;</div>

<div style="font-size: 12.8px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">Thanks for your interest in our company.&nbsp;</span></div>

<div style="font-size: 12.8px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></div>

<div style="font-size: 12.8px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">At this point, you do not know much about our company or how we have helped over 1900 real estate investors acquire over 4000 passive income producing properties over the last 14 years in Memphis, Dallas, and Houston.</span></div>

<div style="font-size: 12.8px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></div>

<div style="font-size: 12.8px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">This email is packed with content for you to familiarize yourself with our business model and our cash flow opportunities.&nbsp;</span></div>

<div style="font-size: 12.8px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></div>

<div style="font-size: 12.8px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">First, you can watch our Quick Start Package&nbsp;<a href="http://www.memphisinvest.com/turnkey/passive-income-jumpstart-package?hsCtaTracking=0fc21674-3e2e-447d-8cd8-b4f9f1ef7e48%7Cab3843e5-34d9-4e86-8761-1fc36ed54d13&__hstc=77998027.e6fdf3ae7eebff947092ce26e32158e4.1462566773631.1486055945546.1486077750461.32&__hssc=77998027.1.1486077750461" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204);" target="_blank">here.</a>&nbsp;This will give you a great sense of who we are and our mission.&nbsp;</span></div>

<div style="font-size: 12.8px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></div>

<div style="font-size: 12.8px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">Secondly,&nbsp;<a href="http://blog.memphisinvest.com/hubfs/All-About-Memphis-Invest.pdf" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204);" target="_blank">here is an in depth PDF</a>&nbsp;that dives into the data on our company and our track record of success.&nbsp;</span></div>

<div style="font-size: 12.8px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></div>

<div><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px;">After going through the information provided, let me know if you have an interest in talking with me.</span><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span><b style="text-align: center; color: rgb(255, 0, 255);"><a href="https://www.timetrade.com/book/ZMBFM" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204);" target="_blank">Click Here</a></b>&nbsp;to schedule an appointment with me.</div>

<div style="font-size: 12.8px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></div>

<div style="font-size: 12.8px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">I look forward to speaking with you soon.&nbsp;</span></div>

<div style="font-size: 12.8px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></div>

<div style="font-size: 12.8px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">Sincerely,</span></div>
</div>

<div style="font-size: 12.8px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></div>

<div style="font-size: 12.8px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">Tyler G.</span></div>
</div>

<div style="font-size: 12.8px;">&nbsp;</div>
</div>

